# Firebase client config (push, FCM). Per-developer and never committed: the repository
# is public. Each checkout that builds with push needs its own copies, per build type:
# androidApp/src/{debug,release}/google-services.json and
# iosApp/Firebase/{Debug,Release}/GoogleService-Info.plist (README, "Push notifications").
# Without them the app builds and runs without push. Ignored at any depth, so a copy left
# in the wrong place is not committed either.
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
